      {
        "id": "model-config-once",
        "moduleId": "configuration",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "warning",
        "title": "补充：集中配置一次",
        "markdown": "实践上建议在程序入口集中配置一次日志（例如 `main` 开头），不要散落在各个函数里。这样级别和目的地的选择只有一处，命令行选项也能在启动时统一覆盖它；重复调用 `basicConfig` 既不会生效，也让“日志到底写到哪里”变得难以判断。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-basicconfig"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-two-handlers",
        "moduleId": "configuration",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "code",
        "title": "同时打印到终端并写入文件",
        "markdown": "如果既要打印到终端又要写入文件，可以同时使用两个 handler：\n\n```python\nlogging.basicConfig(\n    level=logging.DEBUG,\n    handlers=[\n        logging.FileHandler('logging.log'),\n        logging.StreamHandler()])\n```\n\n这样一条 `logging.debug('This is for debugging.')` 既输出到标准错误，也追加到 `logging.log`。",
